# Accepted-risk findings for Trivy's ansible-misconfig/secret scans —
# see docs/ci.md#trivy-security-scans. One shared file, referenced by
# both scan jobs' `trivyignores:` input via its .config/ path — same
# location as this repo's other tool configs (.ansible-lint, .yamllint,
# .dclintrc).
#
# One entry per line: an AVD/check ID (Ansible misconfig scan) or a
# secret rule ID (secret scan). Blank lines and full-line '#' comments
# are ignored when Trivy parses this file — same convention as
# .github/compose-boot-test-exclusions.txt. Attach the reasoning for
# each entry directly above it, matching that file's style, rather than
# tracking justifications elsewhere.
#
# Empty for now — nothing has been triaged as accepted risk yet.
